{"parentUuid":"b5e78c88-aef6-496c-960a-04d6c0b0af54","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"8dfd7d49-883e-40c9-8948-d7864c6a5fee","agentId":"a8a152668dd067210","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011VGV46quB6YKXEa244FheR","type":"tool_result","content":"I cannot extract the requested information from the provided content. The material appears to be a PDF document encoded in a compressed format (FlateDecode), containing what looks like technical academic content about memory access patterns and performance optimization.\n\nTo properly extract per-solver speedup data, kernel versions, hardware specifications, page size configurations, THP settings, TLB miss reduction percentages, and long-running task metrics, I would need:\n\n1. **Readable source material** - The current format is compressed binary PDF data that cannot be meaningfully parsed for specific performance metrics\n2. **Clearly visible sections** - Tables, benchmarks, or result sections that display the numerical comparisons you're seeking\n3. **Accessible text** - Content that can be searched for terms like \"CaDiCaL,\" \"Glucose,\" \"MapleSAT,\" \"kernel,\" \"hardware,\" \"THP,\" and \"speedup\"\n\n**Recommendation:** Please provide either:\n- A decompressed/readable text version of the document\n- A direct link to the academic paper\n- Screenshots of the specific results tables\n- The paper title and authors for identification\n\nI'm happy to extract these performance metrics once the source material is in an accessible format.\n\n[Binary content (application/pdf, 350.4KB) also saved to C:\\Users\\22957\\.claude\\projects\\D--claude-pj-zmd\\7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9\\tool-results\\webfetch-1778185944762-vudqm3.pdf]"}]},"uuid":"d3598170-69f0-4420-af37-bc5b311af629","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:32:29.477Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"b5e78c88-aef6-496c-960a-04d6c0b0af54","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b